          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"summarizing-all-of-the-non-sequencing-data-in-measurementscsv\">summarizing all of the non-sequencing data in <code>measurements/*.csv</code></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>VFA.csv: Contains Acetate, Propionate, Butyrate, and COD for the reactor, waste, and media</li>\n<li>Ammonia.csv: Ammonia concentrations in the reactor, waste, and media</li>\n<li>TSS_VSS.csv: Abundances of TSS &amp; VSS in the system</li>\n<li>Pre-Summary.csv: Defining sampling codes as days of operation</li>\n<li>GC_TCD.csv: gaseous components of various reactors</li>\n<li>Summary.csv: <code>main content</code>.  Complete gaseous ins/outs, carbon accounting, occasional media VFA and TSS measurements</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
